  "description": "The Audax EVO is a refined steel allroad bike built for endurance, versatility, and long-distance comfort. Its double-butted chromoly frame features a tapered head tube for precise handling and an integrated rear light mount for low-light visibility. Up front, the Seido Banjo carbon fork offers internal hub dynamo cable routing and front rack compatibility - perfect for bikepacking or randonneuring. The Shimano GRX 610 2 x 12 hydraulic groupset delivers smooth, reliable shifting and confident braking on mixed terrain. Tubeless-ready Seido Sinus rims paired with a WTB Byway / Horizon tire combo provide efficient rolling and all-day comfort. With Seido Tau hubs and 12 mm thru-axles for added stability, the Audax EVO is your go-anywhere, ride-all-day machine - engineered for adventure, designed for control, and ready for the road ahead.",
